sgp 2

given
  point A
  k1 = circle(A)
    r1: r(k1) = 1
  point B
    d1: dist(A, B) = 10
  k2 = circle(B)
    r2: r(k2) = 2
  point C
    d2: dist(A, C) = sqrt(73)
